(5937806, 865094, 104537, '<td valign="top">Great idea, very creative, the lighting is perfect for this image. All elements are outstanding. Great shot!</td>', 'Great idea, very creative, the lighting is perfect for this image. All elements are outstanding. Great shot!', '2010-04-08 18:41:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5937810, 864315, 104537, '<td valign="top">WOW very creative! I like the lighting. Every detail of the elements are there, the roundness of the skillet along with the shape of the egg, great idea.</td>', 'WOW very creative! I like the lighting. Every detail of the elements are there, the roundness of the skillet along with the shape of the egg, great idea.', '2010-04-08 18:44:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5937812, 865479, 104537, '<td valign="top">Excellent!</td>', 'Excellent!', '2010-04-08 18:46:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5937813, 864969, 104537, '<td valign="top">Very nice, perfect lighting.</td>', 'Very nice, perfect lighting.', '2010-04-08 18:46:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5937815, 865292, 104537, '<td valign="top">I really like this one, the smole and light are great for this image.</td>', 'I really like this one, the smole and light are great for this image.', '2010-04-08 18:47:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5938035, 865098, 10785, '<td valign="top">This shot looks like it was inverted in post processing to get that x-ray look to it. I am sure you have this comment already but I think this is more black on white. I am going to take for granted that this fits the challenge since there are no details given. Also you should take advantage of the full image size available to you.</td>', 'This shot looks like it was inverted in post processing to get that x-ray look to it. I am sure you have this comment already but I think this is more black on white. I am going to take for granted that this fits the challenge since there are no details given. Also you should take advantage of the full image size available to you.', '2010-04-08 22:35:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5938039, 865478, 10785, '<td valign="top">This is a fun capture of your dog. It may have not been possible because the dog may not tak direction too well as a model however I would like to see you get closer in order to get the more black on black feel of the black dog on the black statue without so much background. That is opinion of course. I do like the photo as presented here.</td>', 'This is a fun capture of your dog. It may have not been possible because the dog may not tak direction too well as a model however I would like to see you get closer in order to get the more black on black feel of the black dog on the black statue without so much background. That is opinion of course. I do like the photo as presented here.', '2010-04-08 22:37:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5938040, 865232, 10785, '<td valign="top">This is just a classy shot with great lighting, color and sharpness. You did great with the diffuse lighting along the barrel of the pen. Only possible critique which is just a personal preference is perhaps shoot with a smaller aperture to broaden the depth of field and show the entire pen in focus. But I just want to see another shot to choose which is better. It doesn''t really affect the vote here.</td>', 'This is just a classy shot with great lighting, color and sharpness. You did great with the diffuse lighting along the barrel of the pen. Only possible critique which is just a personal preference is perhaps shoot with a smaller aperture to broaden the depth of field and show the entire pen in focus. But I just want to see another shot to choose which is better. It doesn''t really affect the vote here.', '2010-04-08 22:40:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5938046, 864298, 10785, '<td valign="top">Fun to see the long exposure, however the only thing that looks exposed well is the date on the clock face, everything else is to hot or too dark. It looks like you worked hard to save it in post.</td>', 'Fun to see the long exposure, however the only thing that looks exposed well is the date on the clock face, everything else is to hot or too dark. It looks like you worked hard to save it in post.', '2010-04-08 22:43:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5938051, 864780, 10785, '<td valign="top">The shot is strong because of the close up of the fist fills the frame well however the shot is severely lacking contrast and is very grainy. The grainy is OK because it could be to convey a mood.</td>', 'The shot is strong because of the close up of the fist fills the frame well however the shot is severely lacking contrast and is very grainy. The grainy is OK because it could be to convey a mood.', '2010-04-08 22:49:13.000000', NULL, 1),
