(5938968, 864114, 10785, '<td valign="top">I am undecided on how I like the purple tone... <i>at least I hope it''s a purple tone and not my monitor :) </i></td>', 'I am undecided on how I like the purple tone... at least I hope it''s a purple tone and not my monitor :) ', '2010-04-09 22:00:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5938991, 865754, 10785, '<td valign="top">This is a cute set up. I think it would look better if it were darker with more contrast and color saturation so the pink is really luminescent against the deep black tones.</td>', 'This is a cute set up. I think it would look better if it were darker with more contrast and color saturation so the pink is really luminescent against the deep black tones.', '2010-04-09 22:16:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5938999, 865543, 10785, '<td valign="top">I like how you filled the frame with the cimps and also cropped this so that the mother chimp is not totally seen and acts as a background for the baby. The focus seems a hair off, but it might be because this was shot through glass?? also I would like to see the contrast bumped up and made a little darker.</td>', 'I like how you filled the frame with the cimps and also cropped this so that the mother chimp is not totally seen and acts as a background for the baby. The focus seems a hair off, but it might be because this was shot through glass?? also I would like to see the contrast bumped up and made a little darker.', '2010-04-09 22:19:07.000000', NULL, 1),
