(5939240, 865667, 110533, '<td valign="top">Great picture, but not really black on black, more like black and white.</td>', 'Great picture, but not really black on black, more like black and white.', '2010-04-10 06:34:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5939241, 865621, 43191, '<td valign="top">an interesting image however I feel there is too much white and red for this to be black on black. Only my opinion. Wish I had a chook to photograph :)</td>', 'an interesting image however I feel there is too much white and red for this to be black on black. Only my opinion. Wish I had a chook to photograph :)', '2010-04-10 06:35:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5939242, 865578, 43191, '<td valign="top">definately black on black but not a very appealing shot with the hairs tangled in the brush, I gave you a 6 :)</td>', 'definately black on black but not a very appealing shot with the hairs tangled in the brush, I gave you a 6 :)', '2010-04-10 06:36:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5939289, 865094, 109227, '<td valign="top">I like this, however, the pattern in the background is a little distracting to me.  7</td>', 'I like this, however, the pattern in the background is a little distracting to me.  7', '2010-04-10 09:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5939290, 865605, 109227, '<td valign="top">I really like this one; good concept.  The folds in the background material are a little distracting. 8</td>', 'I really like this one; good concept.  The folds in the background material are a little distracting. 8', '2010-04-10 09:43:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5939295, 864200, 103142, '<td valign="top">I love the top part of the photo, and I don''t usually mind things disappearing, but I really think that on this shot, it would have been better to see the whole tractor. 6 for that lighting on the top, probably would have been an 8 if you had the whole tractor.</td>', 'I love the top part of the photo, and I don''t usually mind things disappearing, but I really think that on this shot, it would have been better to see the whole tractor. 6 for that lighting on the top, probably would have been an 8 if you had the whole tractor.', '2010-04-10 09:49:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5939296, 865489, 103142, '<td valign="top">I do like this one. I''m wondering if you''re getting hit by people saying that the background is grey, not black.</td>', 'I do like this one. I''m wondering if you''re getting hit by people saying that the background is grey, not black.', '2010-04-10 09:50:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5939297, 864969, 103142, '<td valign="top">Strangely enough, I would have liked this better centered (and I''m usually a big fan of negative space. Perhaps because it''s such an interesting face and it has intensity; it feels like the intensity is lost over on the side.</td>', 'Strangely enough, I would have liked this better centered (and I''m usually a big fan of negative space. Perhaps because it''s such an interesting face and it has intensity; it feels like the intensity is lost over on the side.', '2010-04-10 09:52:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5939308, 865728, 76712, '<td valign="top">I like this, it has an eerie creepy feel to it, almost mysterious.<br/>The fact that is is out of focus and a little blurred acctually gives it more character, and the close up composition is great. This deserves a HYELLOW ribbon.<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=866336" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/75000-79999/76712/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_866336.gif'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/75000-79999/76712/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_866336.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/75000-79999/76712/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_866336.gif"/></a></td>', 'I like this, it has an eerie creepy feel to it, almost mysterious.The fact that is is out of focus and a little blurred acctually gives it more character, and the close up composition is great. This deserves a HYELLOW ribbon.', '2010-04-10 10:12:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5939365, 865424, 93421, '<td valign="top">My favourite image in the challenge.  Hope it is doing well!</td>', 'My favourite image in the challenge.  Hope it is doing well!', '2010-04-10 12:01:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5939419, 865094, 10785, '<td valign="top">Good composition using the shape of a triangle... possibly cut more of the bowl off and get closer to accentuate that. Good lighting on the olives with no overt hot spots. I think a simple levels adjustment could have darkened up the background so the texture disappeared.</td>', 'Good composition using the shape of a triangle... possibly cut more of the bowl off and get closer to accentuate that. Good lighting on the olives with no overt hot spots. I think a simple levels adjustment could have darkened up the background so the texture disappeared.', '2010-04-10 13:28:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5939421, 865570, 10785, '<td valign="top">Gratuitious Water Drop Shot!! Could use some more contrast and saturation. The lighting is very obvious as it appears all over the curves and edges of the object... could use a diffuser of some sort. You can also see the reflection of your set up fairly well off the handle.</td>', 'Gratuitious Water Drop Shot!! Could use some more contrast and saturation. The lighting is very obvious as it appears all over the curves and edges of the object... could use a diffuser of some sort. You can also see the reflection of your set up fairly well off the handle.', '2010-04-10 13:31:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5939425, 864470, 10785, '<td valign="top">Nice use of shapes showing a curve with the cutouts. Also the spot lighting is nice and soft. Only real issue is the figure on the left falls outside the light making it disappear and losing symmetry. The fix for that is to move the light or the characters or your point of view so everything lines up nicely and symmetry is achieved.</td>', 'Nice use of shapes showing a curve with the cutouts. Also the spot lighting is nice and soft. Only real issue is the figure on the left falls outside the light making it disappear and losing symmetry. The fix for that is to move the light or the characters or your point of view so everything lines up nicely and symmetry is achieved.', '2010-04-10 13:34:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5939427, 865615, 10785, '<td valign="top">I like this shot but something strange is going on. The left side of the image is nice and sharp and crisp while the right side is sort of blurred or not quite sharp. It may be due to using a very low aperture like f1.8 or so and getting a field of focus of less than an inch. But it definitely goes from the wrist to the right jacket lapel. You can see it on the zipper and the snap.</td>', 'I like this shot but something strange is going on. The left side of the image is nice and sharp and crisp while the right side is sort of blurred or not quite sharp. It may be due to using a very low aperture like f1.8 or so and getting a field of focus of less than an inch. But it definitely goes from the wrist to the right jacket lapel. You can see it on the zipper and the snap.', '2010-04-10 13:39:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5939430, 864986, 10785, '<td valign="top">Technically black on black... Mostly everyone tried to do something low key and I think using a low key shot could have helped create the illusion of being a real car. Try adjusting levels to drown out the texture on the black background and making it darker.</td>', 'Technically black on black... Mostly everyone tried to do something low key and I think using a low key shot could have helped create the illusion of being a real car. Try adjusting levels to drown out the texture on the black background and making it darker.', '2010-04-10 13:44:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5939432, 865551, 10785, '<td valign="top">Now here is a use of a water drop to create interest. You have added interest to this set up by creating some motion which is pretty cool.</td>', 'Now here is a use of a water drop to create interest. You have added interest to this set up by creating some motion which is pretty cool.', '2010-04-10 13:46:59.000000', NULL, 1),
