(5944570, 864969, 5982, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot.  I like the idea of an "empty black space"  It might be a little too wide though.  A real facer might have had more impact though.  Good idea overall! Thanks for sharing!!</td>', 'Interesting shot.  I like the idea of an "empty black space"  It might be a little too wide though.  A real facer might have had more impact though.  Good idea overall! Thanks for sharing!!', '2010-04-13 19:10:29.000000', NULL, 1),
