(5944573, 864225, 5982, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.  A bit too out-of-focus for my taste although I love the movement in it and the faces.  The clearer area in diagonal is a bit disturbing though. Thanks for sharing!!</td>', 'Nice idea.  A bit too out-of-focus for my taste although I love the movement in it and the faces.  The clearer area in diagonal is a bit disturbing though. Thanks for sharing!!', '2010-04-13 19:12:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5944578, 865234, 5982, '<td valign="top">In my opinion, these look like snowflakes and they can''t be black.  But that''s me.  I can''t see on what they are reflecting since it seems wavy.  A bit too dark maybe?  Just my two cents.  Thanks for sharing!!</td>', 'In my opinion, these look like snowflakes and they can''t be black.  But that''s me.  I can''t see on what they are reflecting since it seems wavy.  A bit too dark maybe?  Just my two cents.  Thanks for sharing!!', '2010-04-13 19:14:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5944579, 864472, 5982, '<td valign="top">a bit too dark to my taste since I had to get closed to the screen to see what it was and I still can guess.  This situation, in my humble opinion is sad.  When I see a picture I kind of like to know what I am looking at.  The subject seems to be on focus though.  Just my 2 cents.  Thanks for sharing!!</td>', 'a bit too dark to my taste since I had to get closed to the screen to see what it was and I still can guess.  This situation, in my humble opinion is sad.  When I see a picture I kind of like to know what I am looking at.  The subject seems to be on focus though.  Just my 2 cents.  Thanks for sharing!!', '2010-04-13 19:15:56.000000', NULL, 1),
