(5945312, 865761, 7889, '<td valign="top">I was expecting this to finish in the top 10 and gave it a high vote. I think it''s an excellent shot. Well done.<br/></td>', 'I was expecting this to finish in the top 10 and gave it a high vote. I think it''s an excellent shot. Well done.', '2010-04-14 04:15:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(5945316, 865232, 103048, '<td valign="top">wow, that''s a beauty. Wonder who the 3 were who give it a 1!</td>', 'wow, that''s a beauty. Wonder who the 3 were who give it a 1!', '2010-04-14 04:17:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(5945320, 865232, 108580, '<td valign="top">Hearty congratulations. 10 from me.<br/>At f/14 you were pushing the boundaries of that superb lens as it starts going soft around there. Only solution, take a more flat perspective, pen parallel or almost parallel to your "focal plane". (P82, D700 manual), but you already know that...You can still get the angled composition you wanted but more DOF throughout. Nit pick. Great image.</td>', 'Hearty congratulations. 10 from me.At f/14 you were pushing the boundaries of that superb lens as it starts going soft around there. Only solution, take a more flat perspective, pen parallel or almost parallel to your "focal plane". (P82, D700 manual), but you already know that...You can still get the angled composition you wanted but more DOF throughout. Nit pick. Great image.', '2010-04-14 04:22:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(5945321, 865712, 108580, '<td valign="top">Well done, 9.</td>', 'Well done, 9.', '2010-04-14 04:22:53.000000', NULL, 0),
