(5945523, 864472, 89005, '<td valign="top">Ok Thanks for the comments.<br/>I was really adjusting the darkness lots of times.<br/> <br/>But based on some of the comments on the last black on black i choose to go for at pretty dark finish.<br/>I will post some other versions, in the outtakes, to get some comments.<br/>I get the feeling that it could have done pretty well, if I had gone for a brighter version!</td>', 'Ok Thanks for the comments.I was really adjusting the darkness lots of times. But based on some of the comments on the last black on black i choose to go for at pretty dark finish.I will post some other versions, in the outtakes, to get some comments.I get the feeling that it could have done pretty well, if I had gone for a brighter version!', '2010-04-14 07:10:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(5945525, 865760, 18450, '<td valign="top">Beautiful lighting! What a gorgeous shot! Congrats on the blue.</td>', 'Beautiful lighting! What a gorgeous shot! Congrats on the blue.', '2010-04-14 07:10:49.000000', NULL, 0),
