(5946475, 865190, 1031, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Deen:</b></div><hr/><i>Because there is a tooth mark on the mouth piece and I couldn''t clone it out in basic editing, so I cut the top.</i></td></tr></table> <br/>You might want to go back now and do some cloning to fix up the mouthpiece, and post the uncropped image for comparison, either in the out-takes thread or by itself.</td>', 'Originally posted by Deen:Because there is a tooth mark on the mouth piece and I couldn''t clone it out in basic editing, so I cut the top. You might want to go back now and do some cloning to fix up the mouthpiece, and post the uncropped image for comparison, either in the out-takes thread or by itself.', '2010-04-14 14:33:31.000000', NULL, 0),
